<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεδροπά</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leguminous fruits, pulse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				389a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				750a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				4.7.2
			</span></i>, al.; gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεδρόπων</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεδροπῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				653a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				752a21
			</span></i>.—Acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέδροπα</span>
			occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Python
				1.12
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, and nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέδροψ</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς καρποὺς τοὺς
			χέδροπας</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεδροπούς</span>
			) is found in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				594b7
			</span></i>: but the accent seems to point to sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεδροπός.</span> (Perh. a compd. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ, δρέπω,</span> as if <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερ-δροπά,</span>
			<i>plucked by the hand,</i> cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειροδρόποι δ᾽ ἵνα φῶτες ἄτερ
					δρεπάνοιο λέγονται ὄσπρια, χέδροπά τ᾽ ἄλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					752
				</span></i>
			.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
